rella_06_12","text":"It is the same with me.","jump":"d_counseling_cinderella_06_13","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_cinderella_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_cinderella_06_13","text":"That's why Grave is so magnificent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_cinderella_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_cinderella_06_14","text":"She is beautiful both inside and out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_cinderella_06_15","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_cinderella_06_15","text":"Cinderella and I talk about how beautiful Grave is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}